================================================================================
Which license applies to what
================================================================================

CC BY 4.0 (content)
    Everything under `src/content/**` that is prose: the Markdown/MDX body text
    of posts, and post assets that are creative content (diagrams, images,
    illustrations) colocated there.

MIT (code)
    Everything else in this repository: the site source (config, components,
    scripts, styles, layouts, loaders) and any source code shown inside a post,
    such as fenced code blocks and example files under `src/content/**`.

When a file under `src/content/**` mixes prose and code, the prose is CC BY 4.0
and the code samples within it are MIT.

